{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Living Nightmares - False Familiar",
    "steam_appid": 3680640,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680640/extras/68a73fccee66fe5debc7365b11f6209e.avif?t=1749488198\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An episodic psychological horror experience based on fragmented memories and twisted perception.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re looking at the first chapter of the <i>Living Nightmares</i> series \u2014 standalone stories that follow people grappling with distorted realities, fractured identities, and unsettling truths they were never meant to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>False Familiar</strong><br>After a strange event leaves you disoriented, you begin to question the memories you thought were real. A familiar face keeps reappearing \u2014 but something about them is deeply wrong. You're not sure if you\u2019re being haunted\u2026 or if your mind is turning against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person psychological horror game focused on atmosphere and story-driven progression. Explore your environment, uncover clues, and piece together the reality \u2014 if it exists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680640/extras/d3443c4fd3aa5eaa7c093f16a2c2f327.poster.avif?t=1749488198\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680640/extras/d3443c4fd3aa5eaa7c093f16a2c2f327.webm?t=1749488198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680640/extras/d3443c4fd3aa5eaa7c093f16a2c2f327.mp4?t=1749488198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disturbing narrative driven by exploration and subtle choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a phone to receive texts and check messages, uncovering clues through unsettling conversations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic analog horror presentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visions, messages, and hallucinations that blur the line between truth and delusion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal HUD, fully immersive experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for short, intense play sessions.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680640/extras/68a73fccee66fe5debc7365b11f6209e.avif?t=1749488198\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An episodic psychological horror experience based on fragmented memories and twisted perception.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re looking at the first chapter of the <i>Living Nightmares</i> series \u2014 standalone stories that follow people grappling with distorted realities, fractured identities, and unsettling truths they were never meant to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>False Familiar</strong><br>After a strange event leaves you disoriented, you begin to question the memories you thought were real. A familiar face keeps reappearing \u2014 but something about them is deeply wrong. You're not sure if you\u2019re being haunted\u2026 or if your mind is turning against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person psychological horror game focused on atmosphere and story-driven progression. Explore your environment, uncover clues, and piece together the reality \u2014 if it exists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680640/extras/d3443c4fd3aa5eaa7c093f16a2c2f327.poster.avif?t=1749488198\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680640/extras/d3443c4fd3aa5eaa7c093f16a2c2f327.webm?t=1749488198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680640/extras/d3443c4fd3aa5eaa7c093f16a2c2f327.mp4?t=1749488198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disturbing narrative driven by exploration and subtle choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a phone to receive texts and check messages, uncovering clues through unsettling conversations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic analog horror presentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visions, messages, and hallucinations that blur the line between truth and delusion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal HUD, fully immersive experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for short, intense play sessions.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Carl Williams, a 15-year-old boy, finds himself alone at home one unsettling night. What begins as a quiet evening soon spirals into something far stranger. Shadows shift, silence speaks, and someone\u2014or something\u2014seems to know him better than he knows himself.",
